Screen Open 0,320,200,8,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Double Buffer : Autoback 1
Ink 2 : Bar 10,10 To 60,40 : Ink 3 : Circle 100,50,20 : Ink 4 : Box 150,20 To 250,90
Def Scroll 1,0,0 To 320,100,8,4
Scroll 1 : Scroll 1
Paint 100,50 : Ink 5 : Draw 0,150 To 319,199
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/dblscroll_1.iff"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/dblscroll_2.iff"
Autoback 2 : Ink 6 : Bar 200,120 To 260,180 : Scroll 1
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/dblscroll_3.iff"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/dblscroll_4.iff"
Print #1,"end"
